### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "hiba",
  "email": "hiba@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "ROLE_ADMIN"
}

### Login first to get token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hiba@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

